1
00:04:52,173 --> 00:04:58,173
Based on the true case files of the Warrens.

2
00:09:44,347 --> 00:09:50,347
The Conjuring is a horror, thriller film directed by James Wan.

3
00:14:36,521 --> 00:14:42,521
Paranormal investigators Ed and Lorraine Warren work to help a
family terrorized by a dark presence in their farmhouse.

4
00:19:28,695 --> 00:19:34,695
Forced to confront a powerful entity, the Warrens find themselves
caught in the most terrifying case of their lives.

5
00:24:20,869 --> 00:24:26,869
Lorraine Warren, played by Vera Farmiga.

6
00:29:13,043 --> 00:29:19,043
Ed Warren, played by Patrick Wilson.

7
00:34:05,217 --> 00:34:11,217
Carolyn Perron, played by Lili Taylor.

8
00:38:57,391 --> 00:39:03,391
Roger Perron, played by Ron Livingston.

9
00:43:49,565 --> 00:43:55,565
Nancy, played by Hayley McFarland.

10
00:48:41,739 --> 00:48:47,739
Judy Warren, played by Sterling Jerins.

11
00:53:33,913 --> 00:53:39,913
The Conjuring is a 2013 American supernatural horror film directed
by James Wan and written by Chad Hayes and Carey W.

12
00:58:26,086 --> 00:58:32,086
It is the inaugural film in The Conjuring Universe franchise.

13
01:03:18,260 --> 01:03:24,260
Patrick Wilson and Vera Farmiga star as Ed and Lorraine Warren, paranormal
investigators and authors associated with prominent cases of haunting.

14
01:08:10,434 --> 01:08:16,434
Their purportedly real-life reports inspired The Amityville
Horror story and the associated film franchise.

15
01:13:02,608 --> 01:13:08,608
The Warrens come to the assistance of the Perron family, who experienced increasingly
disturbing events in their newly occupied farmhouse in Rhode Island in 1971.

16
01:17:54,782 --> 01:18:00,782
Development of the film began in January 2012 and reports confirmed Wan as the
director of a film entitled The Warren Files, later retitled The Conjuring.

17
01:22:46,956 --> 01:22:52,956
Production began in Wilmington, North Carolina, in February
2012 and scenes were shot in chronological order.

18
01:27:39,130 --> 01:27:45,130
The Conjuring was released in the United States and
Canada on July 19, 2013, by Warner Bros.

19
01:32:31,304 --> 01:32:37,304
It received positive reviews from critics and grossed over $319
million worldwide against its $20 million budget.

20
01:37:23,478 --> 01:37:29,478
A sequel, The Conjuring 2, was released in 2016.

21
01:42:15,652 --> 01:42:21,652
The film explores themes of sibling relationship,
1970s, cellar, exorcism, haunted house.

22
01:47:07,826 --> 01:47:13,826
The tone is dark and intense.
